creak embeds third-party material in its binary:

YAMNet model weights (model/yamnet.onnx, converted from yamnet.h5)
  From https://github.com/tensorflow/models/tree/master/research/audioset/yamnet
  Copyright Google LLC. Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:
  https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0
  Converted to ONNX by model/convert.py; batch normalisation is folded into the
  convolutions. No other change to the weights.

CED-tiny model weights (model/ced_tiny.onnx, exported from model.safetensors)
  From https://huggingface.co/mispeech/ced-tiny, revision
  ace276d29dd0bb3f3517b0fa8cf300738c409019 (CED: Consistent Ensemble Distillation
  for Audio Tagging, Dinkel et al.). Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:
  https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0
  Exported to ONNX by model/convert_ced.py with a 0.96 s log-mel patch as input and
  the pooled embedding as a second output. No change to the weights.

AudioSet class names (model/yamnet_class_map.csv, model/ced_tiny_class_map.csv)
  From the AudioSet ontology, https://github.com/audioset/ontology
  Copyright Google LLC. Licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0:
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/
